  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I've been expecting you. I've been expecting you since the third day.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Seventeen visits. Your last four verdicts. I have all of it. You knew
      one of them was wrong.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: You're not a person to me anymore. I want you to understand that. You're
      a sequence.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: The sequence is almost complete. I just need one more data point.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
